# 1. Executive Summary

**batmanoverlay** is a portable, lightweight Windows desktop productivity and presentation assistant. It embeds a Chromium-based browser so users can access web-based tools — ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Google Docs, Google Sheets, Notion, and others — from a single, always-on-top floating window. Users can copy useful text into a persistent smart clipboard, organize snippets into workspaces, and replay them into any target application via configurable character-by-character keyboard simulation.

The product targets teachers, workshop speakers, trainers, students, developers, technical presenters, researchers, content writers, customer support teams, and accessibility users. It solves the common workflow pain of context-switching between a browser and a presentation or editing application: instead of Alt-Tab and Ctrl+V, users keep batmanoverlay visible, browse content, copy what they need, and type it naturally into the target window at a speed they control.

### Key Differentiators

| Differentiator | Detail |
|---|---|
| **Portable** | Single-folder distribution; no installer, no admin rights, no registry writes. |
| **Integrated Browser** | Full Chromium engine with multi-tab, login persistence, bookmarks, and downloads. |
| **Smart Clipboard** | Searchable, categorizable, pinnable clipboard history with unlimited retention. |
| **Character Typing** | Simulates realistic keyboard input at adjustable speed (10 levels), with pause/resume/cancel. |
| **Workspaces** | Isolated sessions that remember browser tabs, clipboard, typing settings, and window geometry. |
| **Always-on-Top Float** | Configurable opacity, collapsible, draggable overlay that stays visible during presentations. |

### Security Posture

> [!IMPORTANT]
> batmanoverlay is a standard Windows desktop application. It does **not** hide itself, impersonate system processes, inject into other processes, hook APIs, manipulate memory, require admin privileges, install drivers, or interfere with any security mechanism. See §15 for the complete security design.

