Provide a full-featured Chromium-based browser within the application, enabling users to access any web-based tool without an external browser.

| Req ID | Requirement | Priority | Acceptance Criteria |
|---|---|---|---|
| FR-BR-01 | The browser MUST be based on Chromium (via Qt WebEngine or CEF) | P0 | User-agent string identifies as a modern Chrome version |
| FR-BR-02 | The browser MUST support multi-tab browsing with a tab bar | P0 | Users can open, close, and switch tabs; tab bar scrolls for overflow |
