| FR-CB-04 | The clipboard MUST support pinning entries to the top of the list | P0 | Pinned entries remain at top regardless of sort order |
| FR-CB-05 | The clipboard MUST support deleting individual entries and bulk deletion | P0 | Delete with 30-second undo window |
| FR-CB-06 | The clipboard MUST support user-defined categories (tags) | P1 | Users create, rename, delete categories; entries can have multiple categories |
| FR-CB-07 | The clipboard MUST support free-text notes per entry | P1 | Notes are editable inline; searchable |
| FR-CB-08 | The clipboard MUST display a timestamp for each entry | P0 | Timestamp shown in relative format ("2 min ago") with absolute on hover |
