### Entry Data Model

| Field | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `id` | UUID | Unique identifier |
| `text` | TEXT | The copied content |
| `source_url` | TEXT | URL at time of copy (nullable) |
| `source_title` | TEXT | Page title at time of copy (nullable) |
| `categories` | TEXT[] | User-defined tags |
| `note` | TEXT | User annotation (nullable) |
| `is_pinned` | BOOL | Pin status |
| `created_at` | DATETIME | Copy timestamp |
| `updated_at` | DATETIME | Last modification timestamp |
| `char_count` | INT | Character count for typing ETA |

### Design Rationale
The smart clipboard is the bridge between the browser and the typing engine. Unlike the system clipboard (which holds one item), this is a persistent knowledge base. Full-text search via SQLite FTS5 ensures sub-200ms results even at scale. Categories and notes transform it from a simple history into an organizational tool.

