### Default Hotkey Map

| Action | Default Hotkey | Configurable |
|---|---|---|
| Copy selection to Smart Clipboard | `Ctrl+Shift+C` | Yes |
| Start typing selected clipboard entry | `Ctrl+Shift+T` | Yes |
| Pause/Resume typing | `Ctrl+Shift+P` | Yes |
| Stop (cancel) typing | `Ctrl+Shift+S` | Yes |
