# 21. Deployment Strategy

## 21.1 Build Pipeline

```mermaid
graph LR
    SRC["Source Code"] --> LINT["ruff lint + format check"]
    LINT --> TYPE["mypy type check"]
    TYPE --> TEST["pytest (unit + integration)"]
    TEST --> BUILD["PyInstaller --onedir"]
