# 23. Assumptions

| ID | Assumption | Risk if Wrong | Validation |
|---|---|---|---|
| A-01 | Target machines have Windows 10 v1809 or later | Application won't start on older Windows | Check `sys.getwindowsversion()` at startup; show error if too old |
| A-02 | Target machines have ≥ 8 GB RAM | Application may be slow or cause system swapping | Document minimum requirements; test on 4 GB machine |
| A-03 | Target machines have ≥ 500 MB free disk space | Application data may not save | Check disk space at startup; warn if low |
| A-04 | Users have internet access for browser features | Browser pages won't load; app is still useful for clipboard/typing with cached content | Offline indicator in status bar |
| A-05 | PySide6 6.6+ includes Qt WebEngine for Windows x86_64 | Application cannot embed a browser | Verified: PySide6 6.6+ includes QtWebEngine on Windows |
| A-06 | `SendInput` works without admin privileges for keyboard simulation | Typing engine won't function | Verified: `SendInput` works for standard users targeting standard windows. May fail for elevated windows (UAC prompts, admin CMD) |
| A-07 | `RegisterHotKey` allows global hotkey registration without admin | Hotkeys won't work | Verified: `RegisterHotKey` works for standard users |
| A-08 | PyInstaller can package PySide6 + QtWebEngine into a portable folder | Distribution model fails | Verified: PyInstaller supports PySide6 `onedir` packaging |
| A-09 | SQLite FTS5 is available in Python's built-in `sqlite3` module on Windows | Full-text search unavailable | Verified: Python 3.11+ on Windows includes FTS5 |
| A-10 | Users will not run the application from read-only media (e.g., CD-ROM) | Data cannot be saved | Document requirement for writable storage |

